{"id":489370,"shortDescription":"¡Salimos de acceso anticipado! Quarantine es un intenso juego de estrategia por turnos en el que el objetivo es hacer frente a grandes enfermedades. Recluta a un equipo de especialistas y despliégalos en misiones por todo el mundo. Investiga la enfermedad, mejora tu tecnología y controla el brote antes de que nos mate a todos.","developers":["Sproing"],"publishers":["505 Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Steam Workshop","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"24 MAY 2017","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1591259879","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_d1e27a5c301a3531632b0a0c7ae01e7370dec489.600x338.jpg?t=1591259879","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_d1e27a5c301a3531632b0a0c7ae01e7370dec489.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591259879"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_7233c772cf4d582d479cdf7f3d7b15961a365705.600x338.jpg?t=1591259879","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_7233c772cf4d582d479cdf7f3d7b15961a365705.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591259879"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_0d9e96a9998e2e21302837a09e69262eb6beea64.600x338.jpg?t=1591259879","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_0d9e96a9998e2e21302837a09e69262eb6beea64.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591259879"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_b04e980e0f679af6774d0097a270b846e1a177f9.600x338.jpg?t=1591259879","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_b04e980e0f679af6774d0097a270b846e1a177f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1591259879"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489370/ss_6f61b72d3cc1cf5